e","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LowForSchnorr}\">\\(\\mathrm{LowForSchnorr}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LowForKurtzTest},\\mathrm{LowForKurtz}\">\\(\\mathrm{LowForKurtzTest},\\mathrm{LowForKurtz}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HyperimmuneFree}\">\\(\\operatorname{HyperimmuneFree}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e172de9c93804582\" href=\"?note=e172de9c93804582\" title=\"43-df-lowforschnorr\">43-df-lowforschnorr</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6653f26a3d0abcec\" href=\"?note=6653f26a3d0abcec\" title=\"43-df-kurtz-low\">43-df-kurtz-low</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"df08310d02ee0072\" href=\"?note=df08310d02ee0072\" title=\"43-df-hyperimmune-free\">43-df-hyperimmune-free</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LowForSchnorr}(A)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{LowForKurtzTest}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LowForSchnorr}(A)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{LowForKurtzTest}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LowForKurtzTest}(A)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{LowForKurtz}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LowForKurtzTest}(A)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{LowForKurtz}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LowForKurtz}(A)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{HyperimmuneFree}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LowForKurtz}(A)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{HyperimmuneFree}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>中间一步由零检验与有效闭零类的等价得到；书中对最右端给出比测试低性更强的随机类版本。这里只给蕴含链，不把它们两两等同。</p>\n<p>来源：用户提供的2007-07-28草稿，Theorem 16.4.1; printed p.501 / PDF p.521。本轮逐项比对来源陈述并人工核对类型、参数和去Remark条件；未声称机器形式验证或来源完整证明核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-lowforschnorr","status":"resolved","id":"e172de9c93804582","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-lowforschnorr]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kurtz-low","status":"resolved","id":"6653f26a3d0abcec","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-kurtz-low]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-hyperimmune-free","status":"resolved","id":"df08310d02ee0072","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-lowforschnorr","status":"resolved","id":"e172de9c93804582","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{LowForSchnorr}$、$\\mathrm{LowForKurtzTest},\\mathrm{LowForKurtz}$、$\\operatorname{HyperimmuneFree}$ 见 [[43-df-lowforschnorr]]、[[43-df-kurtz-low]]、[[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kurtz-low","status":"resolved","id":"6653f26a3d0abcec","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{LowForSchnorr